# ViReMa ver 0.25 OVERALL STEPS

1. Download _ViReMa_

2. Install required pgms
	_python_ ; _bwa_

3.1. Secure your Virus reference genome fasta
	- Add poly-A padding to ea sgmt of the reference.
	Padding must be longer than the read being aligned 
	[just make it the length of the refseq sgmt]
	- ViReMa will auto-generate an index file when it
	runs if virus reference genome index is absent

3.2. [optional]
	If you're including a host reference genome fasta:
	- add poly-A padding as well (see above)
	- you must pre-build it's index bowtie or bwa
	use ^bowtie-build ...^ cmd to create an index file

4. prep your input reads
	i.e. trim off barcodes/landingPAD/umi

5. run virema from cmdLN


